Syntax:
arg1 ? arg2: arg3;
if arg 1 is true execute arg 2 
if arg 1 is false execute arg 3

priority order update:
  ! ---> [unary ope]
  / * % ------->[Binary operator]----> [Arithmetic operator ]
  + - --------->[Binary operator]----> [Arithmetic operator ]
  < > <= >= -------->[relational ,binary operator ]
  == != ------>[Binary operator]
  && ------>[logical AND]
  || ------>[Logical OR]
  ?: ------->[ternery operator]
  = ------->[Assignment operator]

